            },
            {
                "title": "Lighting Design & Installation",
                "text": "Transform your space with professional lighting. We design and install indoor and outdoor lighting solutions that enhance aesthetics, improve security, and reduce energy consumption.",
                "image": "images/beautifully_lit_modern_living_7bc025d70e35d5d7eaa64e72e48922.webp"
            },
            {
                "title": "Commercial & Industrial Services",
                "text": "Keep your business powered with our commercial electrical expertise. We handle installations, maintenance, and upgrades, minimizing downtime and maximizing efficiency.",
